<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Oil to restart Kawasaki topper Wednesday.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Oil to restart Kawasaki topper Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Oil Co Ltd plans to bring a 75,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit at its Kawasaki refinery near Tokyo back on line on Wednesday evening, a spokesman for the refiner said.</p>
<p>The topper has been shut since October 1 for scheduled maintenance checks.</p>
</text>
